  "description": "Living alone in self-imposed exile, Mun Chaheon thought he was simply saving a life when he rescued an abandoned boy in the forest and raised him as his own son, Mun Chayun. But over time, Chayun’s devotion grew into a fierce, unspoken passion. When Chaheon encourages Chayun to marry and build a normal life, Chayun shatters the illusion of their father-son bond, exposing his long-held desire for the only man he has ever loved.\n\n\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/809044248), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000107969), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/donga93309)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1286012548), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078268), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/lesson4_silly_father), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/bad_father_lesson)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/lessons_father)",
